[19:41:59] [ModMenu/Update Checker/2/DEBUG] (Mod Menu/Update Checker) {"c8224aa7a460d0c56ccb9978a112e4ad0d3eb17e2796e0c468a2392d220749f4f602838a11b3666145462c26078a879ab8a2fc177aa440f58e189c92a0088d6e":{"game_versions":["26.2"],"loaders":["fabric","quilt"],"environment":"client_only","id":"iRo7AZXf","project_id":"mOgUt4GM","author_id":"uF4fzWRt","featured":false,"name":"v20.0.3 for 26.2","version_number":"20.0.3","changelog":"- Translation backports and fixes\n- Update Polish translations, thanks lumiscosity\n- Update Belarusian translation, thanks The518thGuy\n- Updated Spanish (Argentina) translations, thanks Texaliuz\n- Update Estonian translation, thanks Madis0\n- Use a better word for \"Credits\" in the Russian translation (resolves #1098)","changelog_url":null,"date_published":"2026-09-24T19:34:19.274511Z","downloads":1491426,"version_type":"release","status":"listed","requested_status":null,"files":[{"id":"3bVQn0O9","hashes":{"sha1":"9fc381627b471c18d67156e846228f51ff2ea5b4","sha512":"c8224aa7a460d0c56ccb9978a112e4ad0d3eb17e2796e0c468a2392d220749f4f602838a11b3666145462c26078a879ab8a2fc177aa440f58e189c92a0088d6e"},"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/mOgUt4GM/versions/iRo7AZXf/modmenu-20.0.3.jar","filename":"modmenu-20.0.3.jar","primary":true,"size":616919,"file_type":null}],"dependencies":[{"version_id":null,"project_id":"P7dR8mSH","file_name":null,"dependency_type":"required"},{"version_id":null,"project_id":"eXts2L7r","file_name":null,"dependency_type":"required"}]},"9b7a7aade8824543ce2a804fddfd04e37f57d1f91c00574e7dc87e554eb1835d888313ee6f715a7599bd729840cf01fd74e02aeae87b4e5a3c10c34a016e407c":{"game_versions":["26.2"],"loaders":["fabric"],"environment":"client_only","id":"xJZxADzI","project_id":"AANobbMI","author_id":"TEZXhE2U","featured":false,"name":"Sodium 0.9.2 for Fabric 26.2","version_number":"mc26.2-0.9.2-fabric","changelog":"Sodium 0.9.2 includes a new terrain buffer allocation system designed to reduce the number of buffers that get allocated and resized as chunks are loaded and unloaded. Other changes include improvements to our item meshing, optimizations for item rendering, and numerous bug fixes. This release also adds support for FRAPI on NeoForge.\n\nThank you to all the contributors who added to this release!\n\n- Prevent misalignment in item models by removing UV_SHRINK where necessary ([#3831](https://github.com/CaffeineMC/sodium/pull/3831))\n- Offset overlay layers of optimized item models to prevent z-fighting\n- Optimize the dried ghast model ([#3815](https://github.com/CaffeineMC/sodium/pull/3815))\n- Implementation of an Incrementally Defragmenting Auto-Sizing Multi-Arena Allocator ([#3634](https://github.com/CaffeineMC/sodium/pull/3634))\n- Support FRAPI on NeoForge ([#3818](https://github.com/CaffeineMC/sodium/pull/3818))\n- Fix buffer overflow in Kernel32.getModuleFileName\n- Use the correct atomic operations on NativeBuffer.ALLOCATED\n- Ensure that VKIndirectContext.addCommand allocates enough memory\n- Use clearenv() to delete environment variables\n- Cleanup code around checking the IME status on Windows\n- Restore the fast quad encoder for entity-format buffers ([#3848](https://github.com/CaffeineMC/sodium/pull/3848))\n- Handle resizing the section time buffer to fix [#3809](https://github.com/CaffeineMC/sodium/issues/3809)\n- Backport fix from 26.3 Snapshot 6 for buffer recycling to restore inventory item rendering performance\n- Backport buffer changes from 26.3 to fix severe frame pacing issues ([#3895](https://github.com/CaffeineMC/sodium/pull/3895))\n- Implement override/overlay priority in the graphics options Config API ([#3866](https://github.com/CaffeineMC/sodium/pull/3866))\n- Optimize pitcher plant models ([#3881](https://github.com/CaffeineMC/sodium/pull/3881))\n- Improve mod compatibility by correctly handling vertexIndex state","changelog_url":null,"date_published":"2026-09-11T18:08:28.513893Z","downloads":3011204,"version_type":"release","status":"listed","requested_status":null,"files":[{"id":"EopjrBke","hashes":{"sha1":"62a70961a5b3e06938e06ab5f2dc4c5a51cf3323","sha512":"9b7a7aade8824543ce2a804fddfd04e37f57d1f91c00574e7dc87e554eb1835d888313ee6f715a7599bd729840cf01fd74e02aeae87b4e5a3c10c34a016e407c"},"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AANobbMI/versions/xJZxADzI/sodium-fabric-0.9.2%2Bmc26.2.jar","filename":"sodium-fabric-0.9.2+mc26.2.jar","primary":true,"size":1885572,"file_type":null}],"dependencies":[]},"2502fa5ade78e9a120b3747bc1a9a2167d6671743bea45bf115d3174c94121aeda87c549446d1a604a9c11fb828de17a551e3514ce42f3e93069dd14bdaee55b":{"game_versions":["26.2"],"loaders":["fabric"],"environment":"client_or_server_prefers_both","id":"ewUK83HI","project_id":"P7dR8mSH","author_id":"JZA4dW8o","featured":false,"name":"[26.2] Fabric API 0.161.0+26.2","version_number":"0.161.0+26.2","changelog":"- Bump version (modmuss50)\n- Advancement API v1 (#5499) (Paulem, GauntRecluse, amolinamounier, SkyNotTheLimit, maityyy)\n","changelog_url":null,"date_published":"2026-09-18T17:31:39.163063Z","downloads":3283465,"version_type":"release","status":"listed","requested_status":null,"files":[{"id":"2kO5wd2o","hashes":{"sha1":"332da34ebb72171e603a0c538de17f4c54ea9e29","sha512":"2502fa5ade78e9a120b3747bc1a9a2167d6671743bea45bf115d3174c94121aeda87c549446d1a604a9c11fb828de17a551e3514ce42f3e93069dd14bdaee55b"},"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/P7dR8mSH/versions/ewUK83HI/fabric-api-0.161.0%2B26.2.jar","filename":"fabric-api-0.161.0+26.2.jar","primary":true,"size":2566123,"file_type":null}],"dependencies":[]},"7cf853688ed9b4f508591811b348db304eb66af5452d4fd8340b37486c750388f73471cbdd073cec1456817ccf84281cd0256097835211b9042cfeee6258cfd2":{"game_versions":["26.2"],"loaders":["fabric","quilt"],"environment":"client_only","id":"nJCXY7Tp","project_id":"BVzZfTc1","author_id":"rLbuLV6t","featured":false,"name":"7.2.7-fabric-26.2","version_number":"7.2.7-fabric-26.2","changelog":"- fixed the enchanted skin pixels feature not working properly in 1.21.9+\n- improved